        <p><seg source="#source-35634-35646">ヒリヒリ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35646-35658"><rb>灼</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35658-35666">ケテ</seg></p>
